<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">15062026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Donald Trump's declared the agreement between the United States and Iran complete, saying he's authorized the toll-free reopening of the Strait of Hormuz after one hundred and seven days of closure.</s>
<s>The waterway carries a fifth of the world's crude, and Brent oil's already fallen four percent as markets unwind the war premium they'd built in.</s>
<s>Yet Tehran's issued no public confirmation, a fourteen-point memorandum's still under discussion inside Iran, and the same Washington brokering this peace gave Israel cover to strike Beirut last week.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Russia shelled the Kyiv Pechersk Lavra, killing nine and setting the nine-hundred-and-seventy-five-year-old monastery ablaze.</s>
<s>The site's a UNESCO World Heritage landmark and the spiritual heart of Ukrainian Orthodoxy, and the strike cut power to a hundred and forty thousand people.</s>
<s>Targeting cultural and religious patrimony is a tactic in itself — and it lands as <sub alias="G seven">G7</sub> leaders gather in France claiming to seek an end to the war.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Israel struck Beirut's southern suburb of Dahiyeh, killing three, Lebanese health officials said.</s>
<s>Iran's conditioned any wider deal on ending Lebanon's conflict, and Tehran accused Washington of giving Israel a green light to strike.</s>
<s>Qatari mediators have arrived... and whether this attack stalls the very ceasefire just announced is now the open question.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>An investigation in South Africa found that a viral constitutional campaign hides a demand most of its supporters never see.</s>
<s>Led by a state nuclear employee, Princy Mthombeni, the group wraps anti-foreigner messaging around a buried clause that would place constitutional limits on civic groups and nonprofit organizations.</s>
<s>Parliament's own lawyers call the citizenship changes unconstitutional — and the playbook, xenophobia as the on-ramp to shrinking civil society, is one worth watching well beyond Pretoria.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>France delayed the start of the <sub alias="G seven">G7</sub> summit at Évian to accommodate Trump's birthday, with no guarantee he'll stay the full three days.</s>
<s>He walked out of last year's summit early, and Macron's now pushing him to back a naval task force for the Strait of Hormuz.</s>
<s>Ukraine's president Zelenskyy arrives Tuesday... and the agenda, critics say, has been built around one man rather than the world's crises.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A newer armed group called Lakurawa killed twenty people in a Sunday raid on Fasken Rafi, in Nigeria's Kebbi state.</s>
<s>Distinct from the bandits of neighbouring Zamfara, Lakurawa exploits the porous Nigeria-Niger border to strike villages that lie beyond the reach of state security.</s>
<s>Nigeria's army has set no timeline to suppress them, and the local emir had already pleaded for protection.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>India's Sensex opened up nearly one thousand two hundred points as the Iran ceasefire eased fears over oil supply.</s>
<s>An oil-importing economy absorbs a distant Gulf war directly through its energy bill, so a ceasefire three thousand kilometres away reprices a Mumbai investor's portfolio at the opening bell.</s>
<s>Foreign investors were still net sellers on Friday, though — a reminder that relief and conviction aren't the same thing.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Geneva, a twenty-thousand-strong march against the summit turned violent, with protesters smashing the windows of a global accounting firm and burning a car.</s>
<s>The bloc gathered across the lake is effectively the rich world's economic steering committee, seven nations representing forty percent of global output.</s>
<s>Police made several arrests as the three-day summit opened, and who gets called a protester versus a rioter still depends on which capital's telling the story.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A surge in SpaceX's valuation has made Elon Musk the first person ever to hold a trillion dollars.</s>
<s>His lead over Jeff Bezos now exceeds Bezos's entire estimated fortune of two hundred and forty-nine billion dollars.</s>
<s>Oxfam estimates Musk alone now holds more wealth than the poorest forty-six percent of humanity combined.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Three days of monsoon storms killed at least ten people across Pakistan's Khyber Pakhtunkhwa and Punjab provinces.</s>
<s>Roof collapses and electrocutions, not floodwaters alone, drove most of the deaths — a sign of how early-monsoon casualties track infrastructure exposure as much as rainfall.</s>
<s>The Met Office forecasts more storms this week, and rivers like the Kunhar are receding but still dangerous.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers reconstructed the evolution of fatherhood in harvestmen, the long-legged arachnids, using nothing but photographs uploaded to the citizen-science platform iNaturalist.</s>
<s>Male-only parental care is rare in the animal world, and crowdsourced observations proved powerful enough to trace its evolutionary history where field collection alone never could.</s>
<s>It's a quiet shift in who gets to do basic science... and in what amateurs with cameras can now uncover.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Physicists found that making nanosheets thinner can make them anomalously stronger, reversing ordinary intuition.</s>
<s>Fewer atoms mean fewer defects to seed a fracture, a new scaling law shows — a finding with direct consequences for flexible electronics and membrane design.</s>
<s>The exact thickness where the effect inverts, though, remains undefined.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Britain will move to bar under-sixteens from major social-media platforms, following Australia's ban last December.</s>
<s>Platforms will have to verify every user's age or block young teenagers — and the UK joining Australia signals an Anglosphere standard companies will have to engineer for worldwide.</s>
<s>Privacy advocates warn that proving everyone's age means collecting sensitive data on everyone... the hidden cost of the gate built to keep children out.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Engineers have built an underwater microphone, a hydrophone, sensitive below ten hertz, a long-standing frontier in ocean sensing.</s>
<s>A horn-shaped cavity amplifies the velocity of water particles at its throat, extending reliable detection into the very low frequencies that matter most.</s>
<s>Better low-frequency listening reshapes maritime surveillance, seismic monitoring and submarine detection alike.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A new AI model corrects the uneven lighting inside endoscope images without inventing anatomy that isn't there.</s>
<s>Most enhancement tools work in space and end up fabricating detail, but this one works in frequency, separating light from tissue before it touches the picture.</s>
<s>It outperformed the state of the art across three hospital datasets, where a hallucinated growth could mean a missed or mistaken diagnosis.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>